{"results":[{"url":"https://www.grandislandny.gov/241/Town-Board-Meetings","final_url":"https://www.grandislandny.gov/241/Town-Board-Meetings","title":"Town Board Meetings | Grand Island, NY","description":" Town Board workshops and regular meetings will be open to in-person public attendance, subject to applicable capacity restrictions. Meetings will also be streamed live.","language":"en","text":"# Town Board Meetings\n\n## **2026 Town Board Meeting Schedule**\n\nThe meeting can also be viewed by using the**\"Meeting Videos\"**Icon on the Homepage.  \n\n## Workshop Meetings (6:30 P.M.)\n\n* 1st Monday of each month Zoom Link: https://us02web.zoom.us/j/88261714561\n* 3rd Monday of each month Zoom Link: https://us02web.zoom.us/j/82576582137\n\n## Regular Meetings (8:00 P.M.)\n\n* 1st Monday of each month Zoom Link: https://us02web.zoom.us/j/81733615987\n* 3rd Monday of each month Zoom Link:   https://us02web.zoom.us/j/85242727023\n\nWe ask that if you**do not** wish to speak during the comment section of the meeting that you watch **LIVE**on YouTubeas opposed to signing onto the ZOOM meeting.\n\n**Live Streaming** and **Video Library is temporarily unavailable.**\n\nAdditional workshops are scheduled as needed and will be posted on the Homepage Calendar. \n\n**Agendas**are available prior to the meetings. **Minutes**are available following Town Board approval.\n\nView Most Recent Agendas and Minutes","author":null,"published_date":null,"latency_ms":622.2031159850303,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}